    "overview": "KarunStream is an internet-independent, cross-platform LAN application designed for real-time chat and high-speed file transfers. It provides an offline-first, zero-configuration solution for users needing secure, high-bandwidth data exchange across fragmented platforms like iOS, Android, Windows, and macOS without relying on cloud servers.",
